<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shippin.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shippin.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, July 11 - Karachi - Two vessels waiting off port. One container vessel waiting for two days and one oil tanker waiting for two days. Six other vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
